  "notes": "8-channel mic preamp with AD/DA conversion over ADAT (19\" rack, IEC mains). Each channel has an XLR MIC IN and a 6.35 mm TRS LINE IN sharing one gain knob. ADAT OUT carries the 8 inputs; ADAT IN feeds the 8 XLR (male) LINE OUTs. Word clock in on BNC; sync via ADAT or word clock. MIC IN gender not stated (female by convention). Controls from the Quick Start Guide, 'Step 2: Controls': GAIN per channel (for MIC IN or LINE IN), PHANTOM POWER +48 V (all mic inputs), SYNC selector (internal 44.1 / 48 kHz as clock master, or slave to WC IN / ADAT IN) and POWER. Modelled: nothing passes with POWER off; the SYNC setting is shown but not checked against the clock cabling. Start positions are app defaults.",
